From: Adriel Santos <adriel@adriel.eu>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath11k: fill the 802.11 header rx descriptor ops for IPQ5018

999-233 ("Disable rx_header tlv for 2K SKB") rebuilds the 802.11 header from
the rx descriptor and adds four hw_ops for it, but only to the IPQ8074 and
QCN9074 tables. ipq5018_ops (used by IPQ5018 and QCN6122) already reads the
QCN9074 descriptor layout for every other field and leaves these NULL.

In ethernet decap (frame_mode=2), which the host Wi-Fi path now uses as
well, the first EAPOL frame after association (and multicast PN checks)
calls them: the kernel jumps to address 0 and the board resets each time a
station associates. Use the QCN9074 accessors, as for the other fields.

Refs: ADCDS/openwrt-xiaomi-ax3000t-rd03v2#47
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/hw.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/hw.c
@@ -1476,6 +1476,10 @@
 	.rx_desc_get_mpdu_ppdu_id = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_rx_desc_get_mpdu_ppdu_id,
 	.rx_desc_set_msdu_len = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_rx_desc_set_msdu_len,
 	.rx_desc_get_attention = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_rx_desc_get_attention,
+	.rx_desc_get_mpdu_frame_ctl = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_rx_desc_get_mpdu_frame_ctl,
+	.rx_desc_dot11_hdr_fields_valid = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_rx_desc_dot11_hdr_fields_valid,
+	.rx_desc_get_dot11_hdr = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_rx_desc_get_dot11_hdr,
+	.rx_desc_get_crypto_header = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_rx_desc_get_crypto_hdr,
 	.reo_setup = ath11k_hw_ipq5018_reo_setup,
 	.rx_desc_get_msdu_payload = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_rx_desc_get_msdu_payload,
 	.mpdu_info_get_peerid = ath11k_hw_qcn9074_mpdu_info_get_peerid,
